{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1416436-where-is-your-character-s-onlyfan-page-i-will-pay-for-their-feet-pics-\ud83d\udca6\ud83d\udca6\ud83d\udca6","id":1416436,"title":"Where is your character's OnlyFan page? I will pay for their feet pics \ud83d\udca6\ud83d\udca6\ud83d\udca6","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-01T23:45:48-07:00","id":1416436,"title":"Where is your character's OnlyFan page? I will pay for their feet pics \ud83d\udca6\ud83d\udca6\ud83d\udca6","content":"<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/498704231407288320/760836060874801202/image0.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> This is a describe-your-footwear (or the lack thereof) thread! One of the most neglected part on your character I'm 100% sure of it.<ul><li><i>Augustus (Dawn): </i>Either a greaves as a part of his armor, or anything of black leather, even more so if it goes past the knee since he can't stand wearing shoes (or rather the idea of showing his calves to the public).</li> <li><i>Theodotus (Zenith):</i> Never seen with any kind of footwear ever, the area that he used to live doesn't require the use of footwear and he still keeps the custom to this day, his feet are never dirty for some odd reasons.</li> <li><i>Haeun (Twilight): </i>A pair of hye (\ud61c, \u978b) that he still uses for thousand of years, the sole are upturned at the front and made from wood to protect the silken main body when he accidentally walk into something hard, usually worn with white sock.</li> <li><i>Adnan Sadik (Night):</i> The Circle's fashionista so his wardrobe are filled with hundred types of footwear, ranging from simple cotton shoes to heavy clogs decorated with bazillion of precious material. He really likes to flounce around in the impractical one more than the other practical shoes, other people can\u2019t seem to notice him walking around in these gaudy footwear.</li> <li><i>Basileios (Eclipse):</i> A full-body First Age Artifice armor so the boots comes with the suit, comes with all kind of nifty Evocations on the utility side, wall-walking, sound-supressing, hovering, taking control of a Manse,...etc. Though he also wears a baggy robe and shoes so it would be hard to see the artifact in most case.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 10-02-2020, 04:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T00:01:02-07:00","id":1416437,"title":"","content":"Ah, yes...This. <i>This</i> is what I was missing!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T00:47:24-07:00","id":1416442,"title":"","content":"Knight Raiton wears thick-soled black boots when he patrols the rooftops of Nexus; when he dons the persona of a cunning Guild factor, he wears sable silk shoes protected from the muck of the streets by battens (and those only when he deigns to touch the ground); when he walks among gangs and criminals, his master thief persona wears soft-soled shoes or riding boots as the situation demands.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T01:12:10-07:00","id":1416446,"title":"","content":"Cynis Ganan wears cow-hide calcei, which are kept dirt-and-sweat free by his Lace of Pearlesent Cleanliness.<br /> <br /> Mnemon Danireya wears over-the-knee, sensibly heeled, walrus leather riding boots.<br /> <br /> I'll ask about Gracious Pealing Melody -- I suspect lacquered wooden klompen.<br /> <br /> (I love how Theo's feet don't touch the ground.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T05:53:29-07:00","id":1416469,"title":"","content":"The Sword Muse's light bronze feet are adorned by sandals - cattle skin and several white leather straps for firmness in combat. For combat, tack on polished bronze greaves with an elaborate tree-like filigree. <br /> Leto uses a simple geta over clean socks of whatever stock is available. Whatever's well made and comfortable. How he fights on those I don't know to this day.<br /> Reiko uses leather boots outdoors, usually tall enough to hide a knife. Indoors, at home, a shabby straw sandal that she's had for as long as she remembers is good.<br /> Ivory Wasp uses ankle-high leather shoes stitched on the inside, buttoned. Always new, for those shoes only last about half a year before they start to break and she makes new ones. Wool cloth is wrapped around the shin.<br /> The Architect just walks barefoot all the time, but usually whatever crazy expensive silks and wraps and jewelry she uses hang low enough to reach the shins.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-03T02:55:52-07:00","id":1416601,"title":"","content":"Pacifica wears normal sneakers that outwardly look like normal sneakers worn by any teenager. But there are key differences. The brand she has on it doesn't exist, and the entire sneaker is created from materials that would let her walk on lava, caltrops, broken glass, and slipper ice with equal ease, and doubles her running and movement speed.<br /> <br /> edit: They also look like the colourful, cheap plastic shit a teenager would buy on her own pocket money.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-03T18:10:26-07:00","id":1416660,"title":"","content":"Saw this as \u201cLast Post\u201d on the subforum list yesterday, immediately knew it was a Jen thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T09:52:44-07:00","id":1416733,"title":"","content":"Herald of the Endless Road (dawn) wears big stompy leather hiking boots, laced well up the calf--the better for spending days walking in. They're usually mud-splattered.<br /> <br /> Three Silk Stars (Twilight) used to mostly wear nice court slippers in deep green or blue, the better to avoid drawing attention to herself at the Heptagram. Since she had to flee the Blessed Isle, she's exchanged them for a succession of cheap straw sandles that she keeps losing in mud, streams, swordfights, and on one memorable occasion to a very irritated talking mule.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}